      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ちょ、ちょっと落ち着いてください、アイレンさん。\n興奮しすぎて口調が変になってますよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "5708bb9e29eb06af2217e8eff68cb0a4351e9d0e6c8dceb143a491aac2055436",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "자, 잠깐 진정하세요, 아이렌 씨.\n너무 흥분해서 말투가 이상해졌어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
